{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>新皇崗口岸即將啟用，營運近30年、來往新田至皇崗口岸的「皇巴」即將完成歷史任務。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER.YELLOW-0600.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026l6Sn4HW6qU1791756469.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>清晨5時許，有不少市民和巴士迷到達新田公共運輸交匯處，同「皇巴」拍照留念。保安局局長鄧炳強都有到場視察。</p><p></p><p>最後一班前往落馬洲的「皇巴」早上6時15分開出，之後就會正式停運。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BORDER.YELLOW-0600_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026RBCF44P6TI1791756472.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T22:17:59.708128+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}